        "body": "<p>Incoming - 611 (Contact undefined)<br>Message: Freedom Mobile Update: To renew your Prepaid service, please top up your account by visiting us at www.freedommobile.ca/pay, or call 611 from your Freedom phone. (2024-10-13 12:03 a.m.)</p><hr> <p>You received this letter because you set up SMS forwarding from your phone via the \"SMS to phone / mail - auto redirect application\" (<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gawk.smsforwarder)</a> <br>If you don't want to receive such emails anymore - <a href=\"https://sms.forwarder.api/email/unsubscribe?email=support@avicennaresearch.com&amp;token=nOAuDWvIbr9o8xeYDMmqxf3MmsjIANqE9jfZs9T8VJDCmPXCc8PQGyEPwCAk\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://sms.forwarder.api/email/unsubscribe?email=support@avicennaresearch.com&amp;token=nOAuDWvIbr9o8xeYDMmqxf3MmsjIANqE9jfZs9T8VJDCmPXCc8PQGyEPwCAk\" target=\"_blank\">Unsubscribe</a> </p>",
